<title>USA: Cleveland Cty ISD 29, Okla. won by Liberty Bank.</title>
<headline>Cleveland Cty ISD 29, Okla. won by Liberty Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Liberty Bank &amp; Trust Co. said it won $5.530 million of Cleveland Cty Ind Sch Dist No. 29, Okla., general obligation building and equipment bonds of 1996, with a net interest cost of 4.562 percent.</p>
</text>
